      "side": 1,
      "message": "Comparing this function with `av1_joint_motion_search()`, I see some differences.\n\nThe first difference is the order of backing up in `orig_yv12` and backing up in the `backup_yv12` array.\n\nIn `av1_joint_motion_search()`, the order is `backup_yv12` (line 617), then `orig_yv12` (line 644).\n\nIn this function, the order is opposite: `orig_yv12` (line 797), then `backup_yv12` (line 807). But the comment at lines 811-814 mentions this order. So this should be fine.",
      "revId": "49932c0b8b6e8874edf6b622e16f7ca55e406d2f",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
