      "writtenOn": "2026-10-04T02:06:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yuan: The second difference is that this function uses different index for `xd-\u003eplane[i].pre[]` in the back-up and swap-back operations: `ref_idx` at line 807 vs. 0 at line 846. This seems like a bug.\n\nI think we should use 0 at line 807 also. Since this issue is unrelated to your CL, we can address it in a separate CL.",
      "revId": "49932c0b8b6e8874edf6b622e16f7ca55e406d2f",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
